<title>LATVIA: PAREKSS BANK FIVE MONTH PROFIT 3.01MLN LATS.</title>
<headline>PAREKSS BANK FIVE MONTH PROFIT 3.01MLN LATS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Parekss Bank, the biggest bank by way of assets in Latvia, on Tuesday said that its undivided five month profit came to 3.01 million lats against 2.19 million lats at the end of April.</p>
<p>Parekss assets in May reached 198.22 million lats versus 190.27 million lats the month before, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>Deposits in the bank were 111.17 million lats, an increase from April's 109.47 million lats, the bank added.</p>
<p>Parekss's loans came to 62.66 million lats in May from 56.49 million lats the month before.</p>
<p>-- Martinsh Gravitis, Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
